0 SARRUS LIFT - motorized spatial folding platform
0 Name: sarrus-lift.ldr
0 Author: Designed with ChatGPT for the user
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 !LICENSE See licenses/sarrus_design.txt and the retained part headers.
0 // One SPIKE Prime hub; one medium angular motor on port A; 24:1 worm drive.
0 // Two orthogonal R-R-R chains constrain a common platform to vertical translation.
0 // Saved link angle 45 degrees. Operating angles 20 to 70 degrees.
0 // Actual pins, axles, bushes, stud clutches and keyed drive straps are modeled.
0 // Demonstration cargo is intentionally studded to the deck.
0 // Motor cable is not geometrically routed.
0 // See VALIDATION.txt for the exact digital checks and remaining limitations.
0 // This design has not been physically built or load-tested.
0 // Worm module adapted from corrected Atlas Arm: CrispStrobe, BSD-3-Clause.
